LU: DP_ Buy and sell 1
Success rate: 63.16%

You are given an array prices where prices[i] represents the price of a stock on the ith day. To maximize your profit, you need to choose one day to buy a stock and another future day to sell that stock. The goal is to return the maximum profit you can achieve from this transaction. If no profit can be made, return 0.

Input Format:
prices : An array of integers where prices[i] represents the price of the stock on the ith day.

Output Format:
The maximum profit achievable from a single buy and sell transaction. If no profit is possible, return 0.

Constraints:
1 <= prices.length <= 10^5
0 <= prices[i] <= 10^4

Sample test cases
Input
15
1 2 3 4 5 6 7 87 19 100 11 23 45 67 12
Expected output

99

